        "title": "Fascinating Visit",
        "text": "One of the most fascinating places to visit if you get the opportunity to visit Kathmandu. Significant religious and cultural experience that one should go through regardless of your background.\n\nYou do have to navigate your way through the pesky stall owners that try to sell you items.\n\nIf you're not a believer then you may get restricted access that may limit the overall experience.\n\nIn my humble opinion you need a drive and a driver to get the most out of this experience.\n\nScary but awesome. Smelly and blizzard but worth it!!",
